# Local dev: leave unset (Vite proxies /api → http://127.0.0.1:8787).
# Vercel: leave unset. vercel.json rewrites /api/* to the Render API.
# Do not set this to https://e-inter-api.onrender.com (no login route).
# Do not set this on Vercel — that forces a cross-origin call and CORS failures.
# VITE_API_ORIGIN=https://e-inter-bluewheelz.onrender.com
